      "name": "Trihexyphenidyl Hydrochloride",
      "commonNames": [
        "盐酸苯海索",
        "苯海索",
        "Trihexyphenidyl HCl"
      ],
      "url": "https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=4d4d473e-4f84-43e7-bb17-49e8dc1e97fd",
      "summary": "抗胆碱药，用于帕金森综合征及部分药物引起的锥体外系症状。口服片剂；所引说明书规格为每片盐酸苯海索 2 mg 或 5 mg。",
      "isApproved": true,
      "categories": [
        "neurology",
        "antiparkinsonian",
        "anticholinergic",
        "prescription-medicine"
      ],
